&lt;figure class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-acelon-yarn/Recycled_Nylon_Yarn01_7768583595511495577.png&#34; alt=&#34;回收尼龍纖維 (AceEco™ rNY)&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;回收尼龍纖維 (AceEco™ rNY)&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
